used | `np.nan`     | Missing |\n| 99.0     | Don't know | `np.nan`     | Missing |\n\nI will use the standard name `op_q71_attitude` and assume the label is \"Attitude toward the election\" for the purpose of the code template, as I lack the actual codebook entry. I will document this assumption.\n\nNow executing Step 3.",
